  add_item("dummy", "\nThe training dummy is made of apparently sturdy wood, for it has withstood myriad beatings from Kesrin, the master of bare-handed fighting.  Dents and mars on the wood here and there show that it has been well-used to hone his skills to a sharpness nearing that of the swords on the wall.\n\n");

